WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.240 align:start position:19%
In a single morning, 20,000 people died
where they stood. No war killed them. No

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:12.080 align:start position:19%
plague emptied their streets. The
mountain did it.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:17.480 align:start position:19%
This is Pompeii, the city that time
forgot to destroy. And today, we are

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:21.760 align:start position:19%
walking its streets again.
I am standing in the forum where

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:25.600 align:start position:19%
senators once argued and merchants
shouted their prices.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:29.160 align:start position:19%
The paving stones still carry the ruts
of cart wheels, worn deep over

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:33.800 align:start position:19%
centuries.
What amazes me is this.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:38.600 align:start position:19%
I am walking the exact road a Roman
walked on the exact morning he died.

